","Okay, let's break down methods to control shot hole borer (B. coffeola) in coffee plants. This is a major challenge for coffee farmers worldwide, and a multi-pronged approach is almost essential for success. Here I will break down methods into categories: Cultural, Cultural & Cultural, Biological, and Chemical.  I will also include some emerging and preventative methods.

