*   **Variable Expressive Variability:**  A crucial point is that even within a family with the same *F's1* mutation, the severity and presentation of the condition can vary significantly. This is known as variable expressivity. Some individuals may have mild symptoms, while others have severe complications. This makes predicting the impact on relatives difficult.
