ΔH = -340 kJ/mol

**Step 3: Enthalpy change for the hydration of 2Cl⁻**

2Cl⁻(aq) + 6H₂O(l) → 2H₂O(l)
ΔH = 2 * (-381 kJ/mol) = -762 kJ/mol

