From the Arrhenius equation, we can take the natural logarithm:

$\ln(k) = \ln(A) - \frac{E_a}{RT}$

This can be expressed as a linear equation:

$\ln(k) = \ln(A) - \frac{E_a}{R} \frac{1}{T}$

