","The index of refraction (n) is defined as the ratio of the speed of light in a vacuum (v) to the speed of light in a medium (v_m):

n = v / v_m

In this case, we is given that the speed of light in the plastic (v_m) is 0.680 times the speed of light in a vacuum (v).  So, v_m = 0.680 * v.

